        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we believe that due to the breadth, depth, and quality of our products, as well as the significant time and resources it takes to switch to a different healthcare payments provider, we will be able to retain our existing clients and upsell and cross-sell to them, as evidenced by our Net Revenue Retention Rate of 112.0% for the year ended December 31, 2025.",
